{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "leon-mosaic-star-rosettes",
  "title": "Star rosettes of Alberto Leon’s mosaic design",
  "short": "Leon mosaic rosettes",
  "subtitle": "Mosaic in Islamic Design, from Alberto Leon",
  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of an eight-petal rosette.",
    "A": "Halfway to the next rosette on the horizontal line."
  },
  "fold": 4,
  "star": 8,
  "style": "Islamic",
  "region": "Books and other",
  "level": "advanced",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s LEON7 drawing. Its primitive repeat, tile network and exact proportions match the Attarine star rosettes. This filling variation shares all fourteen construction steps, alongside the Ben Youssef and Seville versions. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The repeated geometry is unchanged. The source’s red and black stars, blue petals and seven-sided pieces, ochre and black long hexagons, and white remaining pieces distinguish this version. The white surround remains divided into the source’s individual tiles. No photograph was checked.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data194/LEON7: Mosaic in Islamic Design, from Alberto Leon",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data194/LEON7.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His reference is Alberto Leon, personal communication, Mosaic in Islamic Design. The page gives no building or country, and notes that the white surround of the black khatem is formed from several white tiles. It links P77 as a design using the same irregular tiles."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. The two lines cross the circle at A, B, C and D. Draw a vertical line through each of A and B. Draw a horizontal line through each of C and D. These lines make the square cell, with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4. Draw a straight line through O and K1.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "C": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "B": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "D": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "B", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "C", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "D", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "K1"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a vertical line through O. The two lines cross the circle at A, B, C and D. Draw a vertical line through each of A and B. Draw a horizontal line through each of C and D. These lines make the square cell, with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4. Draw a straight line through O and K1."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The circle crosses the line from O to K1 at F. Draw a circle with centre K1 through F. Draw a circle with centre O and the same radius.",
      "create": {
        "F": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "ck": {"circle": {"centre": "K1", "through": "F"}},
        "cs": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "radiusOf": "ck"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["K1"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Draw the line through O at 90° to the line from O to K1. The small circle with centre O crosses the four lines through O at S1 to S8.",
      "create": {
        "d135": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "S1": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "S2": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "S3": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "S4": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 135.0}}},
        "S5": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "S6": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 225.0}}},
        "S7": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "S8": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 315.0}}}
      },
      "highlight": ["cs"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Draw two squares.",
      "highlight": ["cs"],
      "animate": "ruler",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S1 and S3, S3 and S5, S5 and S7, and S7 and S1. Draw each line long, to the sides of the cell.",
          "create": {
            "q01": {"line": {"through": ["S1", "S3"]}},
            "q02": {"line": {"through": ["S3", "S5"]}},
            "q03": {"line": {"through": ["S5", "S7"]}},
            "q04": {"line": {"through": ["S7", "S1"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S2 and S4, S4 and S6, S6 and S8, and S8 and S2. Draw each line long, to the sides of the cell.",
          "create": {
            "q11": {"line": {"through": ["S2", "S4"]}},
            "q12": {"line": {"through": ["S4", "S6"]}},
            "q13": {"line": {"through": ["S6", "S8"]}},
            "q14": {"line": {"through": ["S8", "S2"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through F. The circle with centre K1 crosses the vertical line through A at P. It crosses the horizontal line through C at Q. Draw a straight line through P and Q.",
      "create": {
        "fv": {"line": {"through": "F", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "P": {"point": {"meet": ["ck", "gx"], "pick": {"angle": 30.361}}},
        "Q": {"point": {"meet": ["ck", "gy"], "pick": {"angle": 59.639}}},
        "pq": {"line": {"through": ["P", "Q"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["F", "ck"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Turn the two lines of the last step round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {"cp": {"repeat": {"of": ["fv", "pq"], "by": "rot4"}}},
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The vertical line through F crosses line PQ at V. Draw a horizontal line through V. Draw a line through V parallel to the line from O to K1.",
      "create": {
        "V": {"point": {"meet": ["fv", "pq"]}},
        "vh": {"line": {"through": "V", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "vd": {"line": {"through": "V", "parallelTo": "d45"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["V"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Draw a straight line through A and C. It crosses the horizontal line through V at W. Draw a line through W parallel to the line from O to K1.",
      "create": {
        "ac": {"line": {"through": ["A", "C"]}},
        "W": {"point": {"meet": ["vh", "ac"]}},
        "wd": {"line": {"through": "W", "parallelTo": "d45"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["A", "C", "W"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Turn the four lines of the last two steps round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {"vp": {"repeat": {"of": ["vh", "vd", "ac", "wd"], "by": "rot4"}}},
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through W. Turn it round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "wv": {"line": {"through": "W", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "wvp": {"repeat": {"of": ["wv"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "The vertical line through F crosses the diagonal through V, turned by 180°, at Y. Draw a horizontal line through Y. Draw a line through Y parallel to line AC. Turn both lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "Y": {"point": {"meet": ["fv", "vd@2"]}},
        "yh": {"line": {"through": "Y", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "yd": {"line": {"through": "Y", "parallelTo": "ac"}},
        "yp": {"repeat": {"of": ["yh", "yd"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "The vertical line through F crosses the line from S3 to S5 at Z. Draw a line through Z parallel to line AC. Turn it round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "Z": {"point": {"meet": ["fv", "q02"]}},
        "zd": {"line": {"through": "Z", "parallelTo": "ac"}},
        "zp": {"repeat": {"of": ["zd"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["K1", "K2", "K3", "K4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
